'''Gudetama Plate''' (ぐでたまプレート) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Gudetama Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Gudetama Plate
|image = E 351.png
|appearance = [[Gudetama Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 150円 - 592円
}}

==Enemy==
A weak enemy with very low range and health, along with low attack power. Treat it like you would a [[Hippoe]].

==Strategy==
Meatshields such as [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] or [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] along with a ranged attacker like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] should be able to dispatch this enemy fairly quickly.

